invalid type: string "Jvarahesvara is included among the temples in India's 2021 Tentative List proposal for Kanchipuram. The UNESCO-hosted record shows that the State Party submitted the proposal on 13 April 2021; it is not evidence of World Heritage inscription. The proposal characterizes Jvarahesvara as a small but ornate building and a notable example of the period of Kulottunga III (1178–12